  "title": "Cumin Bulgur with Mushrooms and Tomato",
  "blurb": "Tender bulgur wheat cooked in spiced tomato sauce with earthy mushrooms, finished with a hint of lemon.",
  "steps": [
    "Slice the mushrooms into quarters.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a wide pan over medium heat and add the mushrooms. Cook for 5 minutes until they release their moisture and begin to brown.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin and cook for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the passata and water, then add the salt. Bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the bulgur wheat and stir well. Cover the pan and cook gently for 15 minutes until the bulgur is tender and has absorbed the liquid.",
    "Remove from the heat and let it stand, covered, for 5 minutes.",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice and stir through before serving."
